put ue n e
put st 4 add n 1
end
note tyix: token k as an element type: 0 uchar, 1 ushort, 2 uint, 3 ulong, 4 byte, 5 short, 6 int, 7 long;
note 8 when it is none of them. Its size is 1 << (type and 3).
fn tyix k ulong to ulong
if eq tkis k 19 5 1
ret 0
