adefs p q
for li ulong get s2 10
alay li
end
end
if eq nex 0
put s2 12 0
parse2 sigln p q q
eone2
else
for k ulong nex
put s2 12 k
parse2 get exl k q
eone2
end
end
if eq m 4
rsid
end
ret nx
end
note unit: accept the unit at p, emit it, return where the next unit starts.
fn unit p ulong to ulong
q = sepat p
